                                "sense_id": "b193661c-57be-3ff2-875c-f06a95e3ca32",
                                "text": "The whole number of blacks receiving religious instruction from these Christian bodies, making allowance for the proportion of white and colored included in the three thousand Wesleyans, is about twenty-two thousand--leaving a population of eight thousand negroes in Antigua who are unsupplied with religious instruction."
                            },
